# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Build context for the training app image.
#
# Two rules: never copy in what the image installs or generates itself, and
# never let local state or a secret reach a layer. Nothing excluded here is
# needed by `npm run build`.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Dependencies and build output — reinstalled and regenerated inside the image
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/build
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# The sibling products are separate images with their own Dockerfiles
ontrak-tix
ontrak-sentinel
web

# Repository tooling, not application code
.git
.githooks
.github
.gitignore
.freebuff

# Secrets. Compose injects these at run time; a layer would freeze them forever.
.env
.env*.local
*.pem

# Local data and test artifacts
storage/packages
storage/uploads
test-results
playwright-report
coverage
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
